## EMDR Focus — 30 minutes
##
## EMDR taps mixed with binaural beats and a pink bed (entrain extended
## syntax): 500 Hz taps alternate ears at 0.8 Hz while a 200 Hz carrier
## holds a gentle 10 Hz alpha beat under a soft pink bed — three voices
## summed in one tone-set. Headphones required.
##
## extended syntax: entrain

off: -
focus: emdr:500/25 rate0.8 pink/20 200+10/12

00:00:00 off
00:00:15 focus
00:30:00 off
